{"story":{"id":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611","title":{"zh":"星海游牧民","en":"Galactic Nomads"},"category":"stories","image":"art/2173e01a411ccd36e66e.webp","start":"namarian.10","chapters":19,"nodes":28,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"愿凉爽的白天和温暖的夜晚一直伴你左右，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]。我们是[contact_speaker_leader.GetName]。我们代表游牧舰队，逐浪者舰队上所有的纳马里安之魂发声。\n\n你不必对我们心存恐惧，我们的舰队无意对天体进行争夺。我们只要求受到尊重，旅程不受到妨碍。","en":"Cold days and warm nights upon you, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]. We are [contact_speaker_leader.GetName]. We speak on behalf of all the Namarian souls aboard the collected ships of the Pursuing Waters, our nomadic fleet.\n\nYou have nothing to fear from u"},"navigation":{"order":["namarian.10","namarian.9","namarian.21","namarian.41","namarian.500","namarian.505","namarian.510","namarian.511","namarian.514","namarian.520","namarian.521","namarian.522","namarian.523","namarian.524","namarian.530","namarian.526","namarian.512","namarian.525","namarian.513"],"tree":[{"id":"namarian.10","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"namarian.9","parent":"namarian.10","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"namarian.21","parent":"namarian.9","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"namarian.41","parent":"namarian.21","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"namarian.500","parent":"namarian.41","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"namarian.505","parent":"namarian.500","depth":1,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"交易？","en":"A transaction?"}},{"id":"namarian.510","parent":"namarian.505","depth":2,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"请继续。","en":"Go on."}},{"id":"namarian.511","parent":"namarian.510","depth":3,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们很感兴趣。","en":"We are interested."}},{"id":"namarian.514","parent":"namarian.511","depth":4,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们非常乐意支付2000£energy£。","en":"We will happily ease your burden for £energy£ 2000."}},{"id":"namarian.520","parent":"namarian.514","depth":5,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"再见了，[contact_speaker_leader.GetName]。","en":"Farewell, [contact_speaker_leader.GetName]."}},{"id":"namarian.521","parent":"namarian.520","depth":6,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"说说吧。","en":"Out with it."}},{"id":"namarian.522","parent":"namarian.521","depth":7,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"所以呢？","en":"So?"}},{"id":"namarian.523","parent":"namarian.522","depth":8,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"那你想要我们做什么？","en":"What do you want us to do?"}},{"id":"namarian.524","parent":"namarian.523","depth":9,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"成交。","en":"Deal."}},{"id":"namarian.530","parent":"namarian.524","depth":10,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"结束传输。","en":"End transmission."}},{"id":"namarian.526","parent":"namarian.523","depth":9,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."}},{"id":"namarian.512","parent":"namarian.511","depth":4,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"你再卖便宜一点。","en":"Lower your price."}},{"id":"namarian.525","parent":"namarian.512","depth":5,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们付不起。","en":"We cannot afford that."}},{"id":"namarian.513","parent":"namarian.511","depth":4,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"你再卖便宜一点。","en":"Lower your price."}}],"links":[{"from":"namarian.500","to":"namarian.505","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"交易？","en":"A transaction?"}},{"from":"namarian.500","to":"namarian.505","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"说说吧。","en":"Out with it."}},{"from":"namarian.505","to":"namarian.510","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"请继续。","en":"Go on."}},{"from":"namarian.505","to":"namarian.525","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们不相信纳马里安的工程技术。","en":"We do not trust Namarian engineering."}},{"from":"namarian.510","to":"namarian.511","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们很感兴趣。","en":"We are interested."}},{"from":"namarian.510","to":"namarian.525","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们没兴趣。","en":"We are not interested."}},{"from":"namarian.511","to":"namarian.514","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们非常乐意支付2000£energy£。","en":"We will happily ease your burden for £energy£ 2000."}},{"from":"namarian.511","to":"namarian.514","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们愿意支付2000£minerals£。","en":"We will take them for £minerals£ 2000."}},{"from":"namarian.511","to":"namarian.512","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"你再卖便宜一点。","en":"Lower your price."}},{"from":"namarian.511","to":"namarian.513","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"你再卖便宜一点。","en":"Lower your price."}},{"from":"namarian.511","to":"namarian.525","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们付不起。","en":"We cannot afford that."}},{"from":"namarian.511","to":"namarian.525","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."}},{"from":"namarian.512","to":"namarian.514","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们非常乐意支付2000£energy£。","en":"We will happily ease your burden for £energy£ 2000."}},{"from":"namarian.512","to":"namarian.514","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们愿意支付2000£minerals£。","en":"We will take them for £minerals£ 2000."}},{"from":"namarian.512","to":"namarian.525","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们付不起。","en":"We cannot afford that."}},{"from":"namarian.512","to":"namarian.525","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."}},{"from":"namarian.513","to":"namarian.514","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们非常乐意为你们分担1500£energy£。","en":"We will happily ease your burden for £energy£ 1500."}},{"from":"namarian.513","to":"namarian.514","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们愿意为之支付1500£minerals£矿物。","en":"We'll take them for £minerals£ 1500 minerals"}},{"from":"namarian.513","to":"namarian.525","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们还是付不起。","en":"We still cannot afford it."}},{"from":"namarian.513","to":"namarian.525","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."}},{"from":"namarian.514","to":"namarian.520","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"再见了，[contact_speaker_leader.GetName]。","en":"Farewell, [contact_speaker_leader.GetName]."}},{"from":"namarian.514","to":"namarian.530","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"再见了，[contact_speaker_leader.GetName]。","en":"Farewell, [contact_speaker_leader.GetName]."}},{"from":"namarian.520","to":"namarian.521","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"说说吧。","en":"Out with it."}},{"from":"namarian.521","to":"namarian.522","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"所以呢？","en":"So?"}},{"from":"namarian.521","to":"namarian.522","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"有话直说。","en":"Get to the point."}},{"from":"namarian.522","to":"namarian.523","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"那你想要我们做什么？","en":"What do you want us to do?"}},{"from":"namarian.522","to":"namarian.526","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"不感兴趣。","en":"Not interested."}},{"from":"namarian.523","to":"namarian.524","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"成交。","en":"Deal."}},{"from":"namarian.523","to":"namarian.526","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."}},{"from":"namarian.523","to":"namarian.526","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"我们付不起。","en":"We cannot afford that."}},{"from":"namarian.524","to":"namarian.530","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"结束传输。","en":"End transmission."}}]}},"chapters":[{"id":"namarian.10","title":{"zh":"星海游牧民","en":"Galactic Nomads"},"texts":[{"zh":"愿凉爽的白天和温暖的夜晚一直伴你左右，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]。我们是[contact_speaker_leader.GetName]。我们代表游牧舰队，逐浪者舰队上所有的纳马里安之魂发声。\n\n你不必对我们心存恐惧，我们的舰队无意对天体进行争夺。我们只要求受到尊重，旅程不受到妨碍。","en":"Cold days and warm nights upon you, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]. We are [contact_speaker_leader.GetName]. We speak on behalf of all the Namarian souls aboard the collected ships of the Pursuing Waters, our nomadic fleet.\n\nYou have nothing to fear from us, as the fleet has no interest in orb-bound affairs. We ask only that you respect our autonomy and do not hinder us on our journey."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"你们好，[root.GetSpeciesClass]朋友们！","en":"Hail fellow [root.GetSpeciesClass]!"},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"别指望得到我们的善待！","en":"We do not take kindly to your sort!"},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"滚出我们的视线，否则就开战！","en":"Keep out of our way or we will make you!"},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"story.7","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-d79be02ee66eff75"}],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"通常","en":"Default"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 1","en":"Other civilizations 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"选择性亲缘","en":"Selective Kinship"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者 · 机械智能","en":"Determined Exterminator · Machine Intelligence"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者 · 机械智能 · 选择性亲缘","en":"Determined Exterminator · Machine Intelligence · Selective Kinship"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 2","en":"Other civilizations 2"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1,2]}]},{"id":"namarian.9","title":{"zh":"星海游牧民","en":"Galactic Nomads"},"texts":[{"zh":"逐浪者舰队上的游牧船员们给我们发来了信息。他们说他们正在从星系边缘离开并向下一个目的地进发。他们将会去哪？他们会找到他们正寻觅的东西吗？","en":"The galactic nomads aboard the Pursuing Waters fleet have sent us a parting message. They are leaving our galaxy from the outer rim and setting sail towards their next destination. Where will they end up next? Will they ever find what they are searching for?"}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/2173e01a411ccd36e66e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"有人持怀疑态度……","en":"One wonders..."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"谢天谢地。","en":"Good riddance."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"祝旅程平安。","en":"Fly safe."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"通常","en":"Default"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明","en":"Other civilizations"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[2]}]},{"id":"namarian.21","title":{"zh":"星海游牧民","en":"Galactic Nomads"},"texts":[{"zh":"你们好，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]。我们有个请求。在我们穿过漫漫虚空的旅途中，我们中的一些人民心生倦怠，眼中失去了目标。我们不是暴君，因此不会强迫任何人跟随我们完成旅途。所以我们在此请求：你们可以接收上述船员吗？让他们栖息在你们的[NomadMissionPlanet.GetName]上，可以吗？","en":"Greetings again, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]. We have a request for you. As we travel the void some of our people grow weary and lose sight of our goal. We are no tyrants, we force no one to see our quest to the end. So we ask of you: will you take some of our people in? To dwell on your orb, the one named [NomadMissionPlanet.GetName]?"}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"他们因何不满？","en":"Why are they discontent?"},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"他们要怎么适应我们的社会？","en":"How will they adapt to our society?"},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们会接收他们的。","en":"We will take them in."},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们不能收留他们。","en":"We cannot host them."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.41","title":{"zh":"星海游牧民","en":"Galactic Nomads"},"texts":[{"zh":"愿你沐浴和风，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]。我们发现你们称之为[NomadMissionPlanet.GetName]的球体目前并未被你们占据。我们请求：能否让我们的一支帝国在此安家？\n\n我们知道这是个不小的要求——失去整座星系来给我们一个家。我们等待你的答复，无论你如何决定。","en":"Pleasant winds to you, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]. We have found that the orb you call [NomadMissionPlanet.GetName] is not currently being held by your people. We ask of you: could you let one of our tribes land upon it and make it a new home?\n\nWe realize we ask much of you - to lose an entire system to give our people a home. We await your decision, whatever it may be."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"我们不能祝福你们。","en":"We cannot grant you this wish."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"这颗“星球”是我们的。","en":"The \"planet\" is ours."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"不，这是我们不可冒犯的领地。","en":"No, it is ours by divine right."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"这座星系，以及那个“球体”归你们了。","en":"The system, and the \"orb\" is yours."},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"为什么对这颗行星感兴趣？","en":"Why is the planet of interest?"},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"通常","en":"Default"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[3,4]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明","en":"Other civilizations"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,3,4]},{"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1,3,4]},{"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[2,3,4]}]},{"id":"namarian.500","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"很高兴再会，绿洲的[Root.GetRulerTitle]。在周围的行星之间穿行使得我们可以在废弃种群找寻有用的东西。也正因如此我们刚刚建好了我们的新飞船。\n\n事实上我们建造出过量的飞船是为了解决的资源过剩这个问题。我们更希望商队能够保持灵活，不受束缚，所以我们带着希望达成交易的愿景来找到你们。","en":"Greetings again, [Root.GetRulerTitle] of the oasis. Sailing through the nearby stars have made for some particularly fruitful scavenging. And so we have just finished the construction of new vessels.\n\nIn actuality we build more than we need in order to get rid of the excess resources. We prefer the caravan to stay nimble, unburdened, so we come to you with a transaction in mind."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"商队？","en":"The caravan?"},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"交易？","en":"A transaction?"},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.505","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"说说吧。","en":"Out with it."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.505","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.505","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们有一个提案。我们需要能量币和矿物来维持我们的航行。作为交换，我们会交给你们五艘我们的新型舰船","en":"A proposal, then. We require energy credits and minerals for the next crossing. In exchange, you may have five of our newly-built vessels."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"只有五艘？","en":"Only five?"},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"请继续。","en":"Go on."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.510","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们不相信纳马里安的工程技术。","en":"We do not trust Namarian engineering."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.525","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.510","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"这就是我们的行事方式，不断的收集资源，随时保持我们的船坞处于运作状态，这不仅仅是我们的传统也是我们必须要做的事。比起拖累我们的舰队我们更希望看到的是我们的造物被其他天体居民买去使用。\n\n我们能够确信我们的设计不会让你失望。","en":"It is our way, by tradition and necessity, to scavenge resources and activate our internal shipyards when and where we can. We would prefer to see whatever excess we generate is put to use among the orb-dwellers, than have it hamper our journey.\n\nWe believe our designs would not disappoint you."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"给我介绍介绍这些舰队。","en":"Tell us about these vessels."},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们很感兴趣。","en":"We are interested."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.511","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们没兴趣。","en":"We are not interested."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.525","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.511","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"一个令人心旷神怡的回答，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]，我们只需2000£minerals£或者2000£energy£作为回报。","en":"A refreshing answer, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]. All we ask in return is £minerals£ 2000 or £energy£ 2000."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"我们非常乐意支付2000£energy£。","en":"We will happily ease your burden for £energy£ 2000."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.514","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们愿意支付2000£minerals£。","en":"We will take them for £minerals£ 2000."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.514","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"你再卖便宜一点。","en":"Lower your price."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.512","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"},{"target":"namarian.513","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们付不起。","en":"We cannot afford that."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.525","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.525","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1,2,4]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1,2,3,4]}]},{"id":"namarian.512","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们清楚自己产品的价值，天体居民。我们要的不多。","en":"We know what our creations are worth, orb-dweller. We do not ask for much."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"我们非常乐意支付2000£energy£。","en":"We will happily ease your burden for £energy£ 2000."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.514","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们愿意支付2000£minerals£。","en":"We will take them for £minerals£ 2000."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.514","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们付不起。","en":"We cannot afford that."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.525","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.525","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1,3]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1,2,3]}]},{"id":"namarian.513","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们本希望至少能赚回制造成本，但现在只需要1500£minerals£或者1500£energy£就可以把飞船卖给你们。","en":"We had hoped to at least make back the manufacturing costs, but we can give you the ships for £minerals£ 1500 or £energy£ 1500."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"我们非常乐意为你们分担1500£energy£。","en":"We will happily ease your burden for £energy£ 1500."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.514","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们愿意为之支付1500£minerals£矿物。","en":"We'll take them for £minerals£ 1500 minerals"},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.514","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们还是付不起。","en":"We still cannot afford it."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.525","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.525","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1,2]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 3","en":"Reading 3"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1,3]}]},{"id":"namarian.514","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"舰船将开往你们的中央绿洲——[Root.Capital.GetName]？是的。30天内完成交付。\n\n愿你们一路顺风，永远能够得到荫凉的庇佑，[Root.GetRulerName]。","en":"The ships will be driven to your central oasis - [Root.Capital.GetName]? Yes. To be delivered within 30 days.\n\nMay you always follow the trail and find shade, [Root.GetRulerName]."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"再见了，[contact_speaker_leader.GetName]。","en":"Farewell, [contact_speaker_leader.GetName]."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.520","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"},{"target":"namarian.530","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.520","title":{"zh":"加密通讯","en":"Encrypted Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"嗨，天体居民。\n\n我们有消息要告诉你们。","en":"Hey, orb-dweller.\n\nWe've got some news for your kind."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"纳马里安人，请表明身份。","en":"Identify yourself, Namarian."},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"说说吧。","en":"Out with it."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.521","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.521","title":{"zh":"加密通讯","en":"Encrypted Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"你们最近是不是买来了5艘我们新制造的舰船，对吧？速度快而且装配着有大口径的武器？\n\n事情是这样的，尽管你们不是……啊算了，我还是老实告诉你们吧。为了维护这片区域的稳定，和我们定下这笔舰船交易的国家可不止你们。你们的邻居，[other_empire.GetName]同样也和逐浪者舰队谈成了买卖。","en":"You've recently purchased 5 of the fleet's newly crafted vessels, correct? Swift of speed, with large weapons?\n\nHere's the thing, though, you weren't... ah, given the full story. In the interest of preserving regional stability, your people were not the only one offered this deal. Your neighbors, the [other_empire.GetName] have also parleyed with the Pursuing Waters."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"所以呢？","en":"So?"},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.522","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"有话直说。","en":"Get to the point."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.522","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.522","title":{"zh":"加密通讯","en":"Encrypted Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"他们谈下了一笔差不多的买卖，又有5艘舰船即将被送往[other_empire.GetAdj]的首都[other_empire.Capital.GetName]。但我们并不希望舰队里的这些船最后是为[other_empire.GetName]效力，所以现在想要请你们帮帮忙。","en":"They accepted a similar offer, and 5 additional craft are set to be shipped to the [other_empire.GetAdj] oasis of [other_empire.Capital.GetName]. We would rather the fleet's ships do not end up in service of the [other_empire.GetName], and we would like your help."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"为什么告诉我们这个？","en":"Why tell us this?"},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"那你们打算怎么做？","en":"How would you accomplish this?"},"conditional":false,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"那你想要我们做什么？","en":"What do you want us to do?"},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.523","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"不感兴趣。","en":"Not interested."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.526","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.523","title":{"zh":"加密通讯","en":"Encrypted Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们需要得到实际的利益。就算是能够确保得到£energy£1000也比[other_empire.GetAdj]天体居民的承诺靠谱。","en":"We would need something to show for it. Even £energy£ 1000 would be more than whatever the fleet would get out of the [other_empire.GetAdj] orb-dwellers."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"成交。","en":"Deal."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.524","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"没门。","en":"No deal."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.526","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]},{"label":{"zh":"我们付不起。","en":"We cannot afford that."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"namarian.526","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 3","en":"Reading 3"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1,2]}]},{"id":"namarian.524","title":{"zh":"加密通讯","en":"Encrypted Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"愿荫凉庇佑你们，[Root.GetRulerName]。舰船会如约到达目的地——一艘不少。祝顺利。","en":"Shade upon you, [Root.GetRulerName]. The ships will arrive at the appointed time - all of them. Fair winds."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"结束传输。","en":"End transmission."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"namarian.530","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.525","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"真是太不幸了。\n\n愿凉爽的白天和温暖的夜晚常伴你们左右，天体居民。","en":"That is unfortunate.\n\nCold days and warm nights to you, orb-dweller."},{"zh":"炎热而干旱。那真是不幸。我们原以为[Root.GetName]能够成为我们飞船最好的避风港。","en":"Heat and drought. That is unfortunate, we think the [Root.GetName] would have made a fine harbor for our vessels."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"结束传输。","en":"End transmission."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[0]}]},{"id":"namarian.526","title":{"zh":"加密通讯","en":"Encrypted Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"真是太不幸了。\n\n愿凉爽的白天和温暖的夜晚常伴你们左右，天体居民。","en":"That is unfortunate.\n\nCold days and warm nights to you, orb-dweller."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"结束传输。","en":"End transmission."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"namarian.530","title":{"zh":"游牧民族贸易提案","en":"Nomad Trade Proposal"},"texts":[{"zh":"按照我们与逐浪者游牧舰队的协定，5艘武装飞船已经运输到了[Root.Capital.GetStarName]星系，正停驻在我们首都的轨道上。","en":"As per our agreement with the Pursuing Waters nomadic fleet, 5 military vessels have been delivered to the [Root.Capital.GetStarName] system and are orbiting our capital."},{"zh":"按照我们与逐浪者游牧舰队以及其中的擅入者的合约——两支舰队总共10艘武装飞船已经运输到了[Root.Capital.GetStarName]星系，正停驻在我们首都的轨道。","en":"As per our agreement with the Pursuing Waters nomadic fleet - and the conscientious interloper in its midst - two fleets totaling 10 military vessels have been delivered to the [Root.Capital.GetStarName] system and are orbiting our capital."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":"art/b5b6c7440ae71484e037.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[0]}]},{"id":"namarian.3","title":{"zh":"","en":""},"texts":[],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":true,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"namarian.21","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"},{"target":"namarian.41","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-ce2d8e5d203e7611"},{"target":"namarian.500","conditional":t